  "_doc": "#1533 THE declared VR filters (read by libs:ml-l-vision-mlkit FilterCatalog, validated at load). kind: hat | glasses | mask (anchored to the face), sticker (anchored to a detected object's box), background (blur | color | gradient behind the person, via selfie segmentation), lut (a colour look: gain, lift, contrast, gamma, mono). anchor: landmark (face: face_center eyes_center left_eye right_eye nose mouth_center chin head_top forehead; object: center top_center bottom_center top_left top_right left_center right_center), offset [x, y] and scale in units of `unit` (face = the face box width, eyes = the eye distance; for a sticker, the object box width), rotate (turn with the head), pivot [x, y] (0..1) = the point of the art that sits on the anchor. art: vector paths (SVG path data, fill / stroke as #RRGGBB or #AARRGGBB, fill_rule evenodd) in a viewport [w, h], or a bundled PNG ('png': asset path) drawn into the same viewport. Nothing here is typed into Kotlin.",
